1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,534
Hello little explorer

2
00:00:01,534 --> 00:00:05,626
Today we are travelling to discover Saturn's Rings

3
00:00:05,626 --> 00:00:10,230
Let's climb into our rocket and find out together

4
00:00:10,230 --> 00:00:14,944
Saturn is a huge planet far from the Sun

5
00:00:14,944 --> 00:00:18,610
It wears shining rings all around it

6
00:00:18,610 --> 00:00:22,306
Those rings are not made of stone

7
00:00:22,306 --> 00:00:26,530
They are millions of tiny pieces of ice

8
00:00:26,530 --> 00:00:30,754
Some ice pieces are as small as dust

9
00:00:30,754 --> 00:00:34,450
Others are as big as a house

10
00:00:34,450 --> 00:00:36,562
Saturn has many moons

11
00:00:36,562 --> 00:00:42,370
The biggest one is called Titan and it is very foggy

12
00:00:42,370 --> 00:00:49,370
A spacecraft named Cassini visited Saturn for many years and sent us photographs

13
00:00:49,370 --> 00:00:53,560
Today we learned so much about Saturn's Rings

14
00:00:53,560 --> 00:00:57,226
See you on our next space adventure

15
00:00:57,226 --> 00:00:58,426
Goodbye
